---
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
import '../styles/global.css';
---

<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <meta
      name="description"
      content="About Polo Dybala — cybersecurity student and Hack The Box writeup author."
    />
    <title>About · htb-writeups</title>
  </head>

  <body>
    <Header />

    <main class="page prose">
      <div class="terminal">
        <span>$</span> whoami
      </div>

      <h1>Polo Dybala</h1>

      <p class="subtitle">
        Cybersecurity Student · Pentesting · Security Research
      </p>

      <p>
        I'm a cybersecurity student interested in penetration testing,
        vulnerability research, and understanding how modern systems can be
        attacked and defended.
      </p>

      <p>
        This website is my personal collection of Hack The Box writeups,
        technical notes, methodologies, and security experiments.
      </p>

      <h2>$ cat methodology.txt</h2>

      <p>
        My approach to learning cybersecurity is based on hands-on practice:
      </p>

      <pre><code>recon
  ↓
enumeration
  ↓
initial access
  ↓
privilege escalation
  ↓
documentation</code></pre>

      <p>
        Each writeup focuses not only on the final exploit, but also on the
        reasoning and enumeration that led to it.
      </p>

      <h2>$ ls skills/</h2>

      <ul>
        <li><strong>Web Security</strong> — SQLi, SSRF, XSS, RCE, API Security</li>
        <li><strong>Linux</strong> — Enumeration, privilege escalation, services</li>
        <li><strong>Windows</strong> — SMB, LDAP, Active Directory</li>
        <li><strong>Cloud</strong> — AWS, IAM, metadata services, containers</li>
        <li><strong>Programming</strong> — Python, C, C++, Java, JavaScript, SQL</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>$ ls platforms/</h2>

      <ul>
        <li>Hack The Box</li>
        <li>PortSwigger Web Security Academy</li>
        <li>Cybersecurity labs and CTFs</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>$ cat contact.txt</h2>

      <p>
        For questions, corrections, or collaboration:
      </p>

      <ul>
        <li>
          GitHub:
          <a
            href="https://github.com/polo-dybala"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
          >
            @polo-dybala
          </a>
        </li>

        <li>Discord: @polodybala</li>
      </ul>

      <blockquote>
        Learn. Break. Understand. Improve. And the very important sleep
      </blockquote>
    </main>

    <Footer />
  </body>
</html>

<style>
  .page {
    max-width: 720px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 3.5rem 1.5rem 4rem;
  }

  .terminal {
    font-family: JetBrains Mono, Fira Code, Consolas, monospace;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
  }

  .terminal span {
    color: var(--color-accent);
  }

  h1 {
    margin-top: 0;
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }

  .subtitle {
    color: var(--color-accent) !important;
    font-family: JetBrains Mono, Fira Code, Consolas, monospace;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
  }

  .prose ul {
    padding-left: 1.4rem;
  }

  .prose li {
    margin-bottom: 0.6rem;
    color: var(--color-text-secondary);
  }

  .prose strong {
    color: var(--color-text);
  }

  .prose pre {
    margin: 1.5rem 0;
  }

  .prose blockquote {
    margin-top: 3rem;
  }
</style>